{
  "title": "He Who Wields the Authority of the Gods ~I'm Despised for Having an Ability Score of \"0,\" But I'm Actually One of the World's Strongest~",
  "description": "Over a hundred years have passed since the emergence of \"Ability Users,\" those who possess supernatural powers and the monstrous aberrations that can only be defeated by said powers. \n\nLiving in such a time, Yanagi Hayato's ability score is \"0\" marks him as a powerless individual, subjecting him to  a life of constant oppression and mistreatment.\n\nIn reality, Hayato's displayed score is nothing more than a bug caused by his ability, [Transcendent], the power to \"sublimate himself into any existence.\" But the truth is, he's just been hiding the power to easily annihilate monsters―?!",
  "artist": "Sakurai Nao",
  "author": "Kuro (II)",
